[{"start": 5.15, "end": 9.779, "text": "I was the girl in the village doing all right"}, {"start": 59.07, "end": 63.243, "text": "We'd already be there if amber didn't take so long to get ready."}, {"start": 62.143, "end": 64.97, "text": "I had to find my derby tiara."}, {"start": 63.87, "end": 67.164, "text": "That's the best thing about flying derby."}, {"start": 66.064, "end": 68.167, "text": "Everyone dresses up."}, {"start": 67.067, "end": 71.57, "text": "The best thing about the flying derby is the race."}, {"start": 70.47, "end": 74.261, "text": "It's my favorite sport in the whole kingdom."}, {"start": 73.513, "end": 76.37, "text": "Sofia used to pretend to race"}, {"start": 75.27, "end": 78.17, "text": "Using our old mop as her flying horse."}, {"start": 77.07, "end": 79.436, "text": "Can we go any faster?"}, {"start": 78.336, "end": 81.309, "text": "I don't want to miss anything."}, {"start": 80.209, "end": 84.598, "text": "Coachman, better take the high road."}, {"start": 83.498, "end": 86.949, "text": "Yes, your majesty."}, {"start": 96.33, "end": 98.897, "text": "We're just in time."}, {"start": 97.797, "end": 101.83, "text": "The race is about to start."}, {"start": 107.09, "end": 111.89, "text": "You know, sofia, royal prep has a flying derby team, too."}, {"start": 110.79, "end": 112.49, "text": "It does?"}, {"start": 113.061, "end": 115.865, "text": "And we start practicing for it tomorrow."}, {"start": 114.765, "end": 117.515, "text": "You could come watch, if you want."}, {"start": 116.415, "end": 119.314, "text": "I'm going. Prince hugo will be there."}, {"start": 118.214, "end": 121.27, "text": "He's the best rider in the whole school."}, {"start": 120.55, "end": 123.549, "text": "I'm as good as hugo."}, {"start": 122.449, "end": 126.049, "text": "oh, you didn't even make the team last year."}, {"start": 124.949, "end": 127.67, "text": "This year will be different."}, {"start": 133.649, "end": 136.31, "text": "What a great race!"}, {"start": 142.13, "end": 143.54, "text": "Yeah!"}, {"start": 142.44, "end": 145.71, "text": "Oh, it would be so much fun"}, {"start": 144.61, "end": 147.29, "text": "To ride in the flying derby."}, {"start": 146.19, "end": 149.05, "text": "You should come watch flying derby practice"}, {"start": 147.95, "end": 150.529, "text": "At school tomorrow."}, {"start": 149.429, "end": 152.15, "text": "Hmm..."}, {"start": 151.05, "end": 155.29, "text": "Maybe I will."}, {"start": 159.149, "end": 162.135, "text": "Prince hugo. Princess amber."}, {"start": 161.035, "end": 164.6, "text": "I just wanted to wish you luck."}, {"start": 163.5, "end": 165.65, "text": "I'm your biggest fan."}, {"start": 164.55, "end": 167.93, "text": "You must be if you're coming to watch practice."}, {"start": 166.83, "end": 170.57, "text": "The real show will be the try-out race."}, {"start": 169.47, "end": 173.319, "text": "Okay, boys! Let's get started."}, {"start": 172.219, "end": 174.969, "text": "Time to fly."}, {"start": 173.869, "end": 178.57, "text": "Sofia: Hey, amber!"}, {"start": 178.099, "end": 181.85, "text": "Sofia! The bleachers are this way."}, {"start": 181.221, "end": 186.08, "text": "Good morning! Who's ready to race some flying horses?"}, {"start": 184.98, "end": 187.47, "text": "Good morning, sir gilliam."}, {"start": 186.37, "end": 188.85, "text": "Oh. Hello, princess."}, {"start": 188.21, "end": 191.099, "text": "The bleachers are right over there."}, {"start": 189.999, "end": 192.997, "text": "I didn't come to watch, sir gilliam."}, {"start": 191.897, "end": 195.98, "text": "I came to try out for the team."}, {"start": 194.88, "end": 196.925, "text": "What?! What?!"}, {"start": 195.825, "end": 197.398, "text": "What?!"}, {"start": 196.298, "end": 198.83, "text": "What... What's wrong?"}, {"start": 197.993, "end": 201.693, "text": "Umm, only princes can ride in the flying derby."}, {"start": 200.593, "end": 205.51, "text": "So, princesses can't try out?"}, {"start": 206.02, "end": 212.029, "text": "The flying derby is just not a princess thing."}, {"start": 329.73, "end": 334.241, "text": "Okay. I went to try out for the flying derby team."}, {"start": 333.141, "end": 335.581, "text": "That sounds like fun."}, {"start": 334.481, "end": 337.958, "text": "Hmm...I wish it had been fun."}, {"start": 336.858, "end": 339.47, "text": "Uh-oh. What's wrong?"}, {"start": 338.37, "end": 342.229, "text": "Everyone said that only boys should do it."}, {"start": 341.13, "end": 345.5, "text": "What! Robin have you ever heard anything so ridiculous?"}, {"start": 344.4, "end": 348.635, "text": "I don't know. You say ridiculous things all the time."}, {"start": 347.535, "end": 349.692, "text": "Hey, I'm serious, sofia."}, {"start": 348.945, "end": 351.837, "text": "If you want to ride those flying fleabags"}, {"start": 351.173, "end": 353.435, "text": "And I don't know why you would,"}, {"start": 352.335, "end": 356.09, "text": "Makes me dizzy just thinking about it"}, {"start": 354.99, "end": 357.896, "text": "But if you really want to do it,"}, {"start": 356.796, "end": 359.39, "text": "Then I say go for it!"}, {"start": 358.53, "end": 361.23, "text": "There's a first time for everything."}, {"start": 360.13, "end": 363.79, "text": "Huh. You're right, clover."}, {"start": 362.69, "end": 366.349, "text": "Huh, there really is a first time for everything."}, {"start": 365.249, "end": 368.93, "text": "How was flying derby practice today, james?"}, {"start": 368.31, "end": 372.307, "text": "So, then you did actually practice?"}, {"start": 371.207, "end": 373.798, "text": "More or less."}, {"start": 372.698, "end": 375.625, "text": "I have an announcement."}, {"start": 374.525, "end": 378.984, "text": "I'm going to try out for the team!"}, {"start": 377.884, "end": 380.955, "text": "Sofia, I already told you,"}, {"start": 379.855, "end": 382.181, "text": "Princesses don't do that."}, {"start": 381.082, "end": 384.469, "text": "Well, there's a first time for everything, amber."}, {"start": 383.369, "end": 387.73, "text": "I think it's a wonderful idea."}, {"start": 386.63, "end": 388.667, "text": "As do I."}, {"start": 387.567, "end": 391.04, "text": "But she doesn't know anything about flying derby."}, {"start": 389.94, "end": 392.664, "text": "She can't even ride a horse."}, {"start": 391.564, "end": 394.85, "text": "Then someone will have to teach her."}, {"start": 393.75, "end": 397.009, "text": "Someone like you, james."}, {"start": 395.909, "end": 398.089, "text": "Me? But--what"}, {"start": 396.989, "end": 399.015, "text": "But what?"}, {"start": 397.915, "end": 401.33, "text": "What will the other princes say?"}, {"start": 400.23, "end": 402.71, "text": "They'll be too busy laughing to say anything."}, {"start": 401.893, "end": 405.724, "text": "They'll say what a great brother you are, james."}, {"start": 404.624, "end": 408.83, "text": "And you'll get in some extra practice."}, {"start": 407.73, "end": 410.51, "text": "But she doesn't even have riding clothes."}, {"start": 409.41, "end": 412.75, "text": "She will, by morning."}, {"start": 411.65, "end": 413.87, "text": "Thanks, baileywick."}, {"start": 412.77, "end": 415.06, "text": "It's settled, then."}, {"start": 418.43, "end": 422.09, "text": "Sir gilliam?"}, {"start": 420.99, "end": 422.495, "text": "Huh? Oh."}, {"start": 421.395, "end": 423.71, "text": "It's you again."}, {"start": 422.61, "end": 425.33, "text": "I'm ready to practice."}, {"start": 424.23, "end": 426.86, "text": "Can I have a horse, please?"}, {"start": 425.76, "end": 428.51, "text": "Well, there's only one horse left,"}, {"start": 427.41, "end": 429.65, "text": "And nobody wants him."}, {"start": 428.55, "end": 430.795, "text": "I do."}, {"start": 429.695, "end": 434.23, "text": "You do? Of course you do."}, {"start": 436.43, "end": 438.445, "text": "Wow."}, {"start": 437.345, "end": 441.189, "text": "What a beautiful horse."}, {"start": 440.089, "end": 443.93, "text": "Oh, not him!"}, {"start": 442.83, "end": 446.77, "text": "Minimus."}, {"start": 446.309, "end": 451.03, "text": "He's all yours."}, {"start": 450.45, "end": 453.744, "text": "Hi there, minimus. Hmm..."}, {"start": 452.644, "end": 455.39, "text": "I'm sofia. hello."}, {"start": 454.29, "end": 457.789, "text": "Will you be my horse in the flying derby?"}, {"start": 456.689, "end": 459.289, "text": "Oh, you don't want to ride me, princess,"}, {"start": 458.189, "end": 460.699, "text": "If--if--only you spoke horse,"}, {"start": 459.599, "end": 461.828, "text": "I could tell you."}, {"start": 460.728, "end": 463.33, "text": "I can speak horse."}, {"start": 462.23, "end": 465.267, "text": "Oh! Wow, oh, what? How?"}, {"start": 464.167, "end": 467.205, "text": "Because of my amulet."}, {"start": 466.105, "end": 468.521, "text": "The amulet of avalor."}, {"start": 467.421, "end": 470.843, "text": "It gives me the power to talk to animals."}, {"start": 469.743, "end": 472.789, "text": "Well, then, let me give you a piece of advice."}, {"start": 471.69, "end": 474.799, "text": "If you want to win, you'll pick another horse."}, {"start": 473.7, "end": 476.765, "text": "You see, I have short legs,"}, {"start": 475.665, "end": 477.5, "text": "Small wings,"}, {"start": 476.4, "end": 482.23, "text": "I don't fly fast, I worry about everything."}, {"start": 481.13, "end": 483.87, "text": "I think you're perfect,"}, {"start": 482.77, "end": 486.959, "text": "Just the way you are."}, {"start": 485.86, "end": 488.409, "text": "Really?"}, {"start": 495.95, "end": 498.75, "text": "Sir gilliam: All right, everyone!"}, {"start": 498.783, "end": 502.49, "text": "The try-out race is at the end of the week,"}, {"start": 501.39, "end": 505.415, "text": "Right here on our derby course."}, {"start": 504.315, "end": 507.135, "text": "Only the first two riders"}, {"start": 506.035, "end": 509.466, "text": "To cross the finish line make the team."}, {"start": 508.366, "end": 512.886, "text": "So, let's practice hard, fly fast,"}, {"start": 511.786, "end": 516.109, "text": "And always be royal."}, {"start": 526.17, "end": 530.438, "text": "Let me help you."}, {"start": 529.338, "end": 531.23, "text": "Thanks."}, {"start": 533.31, "end": 537.13, "text": "Thanks, james."}, {"start": 536.03, "end": 539.277, "text": "Uh, now what do I do?"}, {"start": 538.177, "end": 540.617, "text": "When you're done, james,"}, {"start": 539.517, "end": 544.989, "text": "Can you help my sister get on her pony?"}, {"start": 544.889, "end": 549.109, "text": "Let's go over here, where no one can see us."}, {"start": 548.009, "end": 551.45, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 550.35, "end": 554.15, "text": "All you have to do is flick the reins to take off,"}, {"start": 553.23, "end": 555.87, "text": "Pull them the way you want to go."}, {"start": 554.77, "end": 556.79, "text": "That's it?"}, {"start": 555.69, "end": 558.169, "text": "Yep. It's easy."}, {"start": 557.069, "end": 560.919, "text": "Okay. Here we go, minimus."}, {"start": 560.504, "end": 565.03, "text": "Hee-yaw! Okay, whoa, here we go!"}, {"start": 579.93, "end": 584.03, "text": "Aah! Oh!"}, {"start": 590.91, "end": 593.877, "text": "What am I doing wrong?"}, {"start": 592.777, "end": 596.54, "text": "I don't know. We can stop if you want."}, {"start": 595.44, "end": 597.71, "text": "I am not giving up."}, {"start": 596.61, "end": 599.95, "text": "I don't care how many times I fall."}, {"start": 598.85, "end": 602.929, "text": "I am going to try out for the team."}, {"start": 601.829, "end": 605.01, "text": "You've got to stay on your horse first."}, {"start": 603.91, "end": 606.95, "text": "I knew you were a bad racer, james,"}, {"start": 605.85, "end": 608.509, "text": "But you're a worse teacher."}, {"start": 607.409, "end": 611.21, "text": "I guess flying derby isn't a princess thing after all."}, {"start": 610.11, "end": 613.609, "text": "You can make fun of me all you want, hugo,"}, {"start": 612.509, "end": 616.63, "text": "But not my sister."}, {"start": 616.17, "end": 618.763, "text": "If you're not going to give up,"}, {"start": 617.663, "end": 619.61, "text": "I won't either."}, {"start": 620.61, "end": 624.365, "text": "Climb aboard, sofia."}, {"start": 623.265, "end": 625.25, "text": "Okay..."}, {"start": 624.15, "end": 627.035, "text": "Now keep your hands on my hands."}, {"start": 625.935, "end": 628.41, "text": "Ready? Uh-huh."}, {"start": 636.829, "end": 639.934, "text": "All right, so far so good."}, {"start": 638.834, "end": 641.88, "text": "Now this is how you steer."}, {"start": 645.569, "end": 650.35, "text": "Amber, is that your sister up there?"}, {"start": 649.25, "end": 653.22, "text": "Oh. I can't believe she's really doing it."}, {"start": 652.12, "end": 655.13, "text": "I can't believe I'm really doing it!"}, {"start": 654.03, "end": 657.369, "text": "You sure are. I can fly!"}, {"start": 656.269, "end": 659.6, "text": "Now let's teach you how to race."}, {"start": 680.79, "end": 684.229, "text": "All right, it's time you tried the last hurdle."}, {"start": 683.129, "end": 686.021, "text": "It's the toughest part of the course."}, {"start": 684.921, "end": 687.778, "text": "Right before the finish line."}, {"start": 686.678, "end": 691.016, "text": "We go under the gate, and through the steeple."}, {"start": 689.916, "end": 693.19, "text": "Come on!"}, {"start": 704.27, "end": 707.059, "text": "We're not going to make it, sofia!"}, {"start": 706.634, "end": 712.235, "text": "If james can do it, so can we!"}, {"start": 711.135, "end": 713.51, "text": "Minimus: Not necessarily!"}, {"start": 719.97, "end": 722.6, "text": "Looking good, james!"}, {"start": 721.5, "end": 725.51, "text": "That's your fastest run ever!"}, {"start": 730.05, "end": 733.862, "text": "You'll get it next time."}, {"start": 732.762, "end": 735.489, "text": "I hope so."}, {"start": 736.922, "end": 739.14, "text": "Sofia? Are you okay?"}, {"start": 738.04, "end": 740.967, "text": "I saw you almost crashed."}, {"start": 739.867, "end": 742.992, "text": "I guess I need more practice."}, {"start": 741.892, "end": 745.516, "text": "But you only have one day left before the race."}, {"start": 744.416, "end": 746.647, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 746.113, "end": 749.585, "text": "Sofia. Maybe the princes are just..."}, {"start": 748.485, "end": 750.597, "text": "Better at this."}, {"start": 749.497, "end": 752.48, "text": "I think you should stop."}, {"start": 751.38, "end": 755.53, "text": "I don't want you to get hurt."}, {"start": 765.77, "end": 769.092, "text": "So, uh, how'd it go?"}, {"start": 767.992, "end": 769.537, "text": "Lousy."}, {"start": 768.437, "end": 771.989, "text": "I can't even make it to the finish line,"}, {"start": 770.889, "end": 775.07, "text": "And I only have one more day until the race."}, {"start": 773.97, "end": 776.72, "text": "Amber said I should quit."}, {"start": 775.62, "end": 778.85, "text": "I don't know what to do."}, {"start": 777.75, "end": 780.75, "text": "My mother had a saying."}, {"start": 779.65, "end": 782.967, "text": "The early bird gets the worm."}, {"start": 782.235, "end": 785.989, "text": "What does sofia need a worm for?"}, {"start": 785.592, "end": 787.395, "text": "She doesn't need mia."}, {"start": 786.295, "end": 789.26, "text": "Hey, what robin's trying to say is,"}, {"start": 788.16, "end": 790.481, "text": "Get a early start tomorrow."}, {"start": 789.381, "end": 792.539, "text": "You've got one more day, sofia."}, {"start": 791.85, "end": 794.801, "text": "Make it count!"}, {"start": 793.701, "end": 797.27, "text": "Good idea. Thanks guys."}, {"start": 856.65, "end": 860.39, "text": "Okay, minimus, we can do it this time."}, {"start": 859.29, "end": 862.549, "text": "That's what you said the last four times."}, {"start": 861.449, "end": 865.45, "text": "Well, here we go!"}, {"start": 887.67, "end": 890.237, "text": "It's all my fault."}, {"start": 889.137, "end": 892.876, "text": "You should switch to a bigger horse."}, {"start": 891.776, "end": 894.084, "text": "You're big enough."}, {"start": 892.984, "end": 895.89, "text": "A faster horse, then."}, {"start": 894.79, "end": 897.89, "text": "Minimus, you're plenty fast."}, {"start": 896.79, "end": 899.29, "text": "You can talk to your horse"}, {"start": 898.19, "end": 899.907, "text": "All you want."}, {"start": 898.807, "end": 901.894, "text": "But it's not going to get you through that steeple."}, {"start": 900.794, "end": 903.649, "text": "And if you can't finish the race,"}, {"start": 902.549, "end": 905.45, "text": "Why even bother starting it?"}, {"start": 904.35, "end": 907.475, "text": "You should go back where you belong."}, {"start": 906.375, "end": 909.86, "text": "With the other princesses."}, {"start": 914.97, "end": 916.527, "text": "Hi, sofia!"}, {"start": 915.885, "end": 920.158, "text": "Mom. What are you doing out here?"}, {"start": 919.058, "end": 921.443, "text": "Waiting for you."}, {"start": 920.772, "end": 924.199, "text": "Wow, you've been practicing all this time?"}, {"start": 923.099, "end": 924.934, "text": "Uh-huh."}, {"start": 923.834, "end": 926.75, "text": "Well, I have some good news."}, {"start": 925.649, "end": 928.473, "text": "Your father and I are coming to"}, {"start": 927.373, "end": 929.33, "text": "The try-out race tomorrow."}, {"start": 928.23, "end": 931.943, "text": "Oh! You don't have to do that."}, {"start": 930.843, "end": 934.4, "text": "Oh, we wouldn't miss it for the world."}, {"start": 933.3, "end": 937.984, "text": "It's just that, I'm thinking about not going."}, {"start": 937.387, "end": 940.13, "text": "I still can't make it through the last steeple."}, {"start": 939.441, "end": 943.01, "text": "Maybe hugo and amber are right."}, {"start": 941.91, "end": 945.184, "text": "And only princes should race."}, {"start": 944.084, "end": 947.483, "text": "And maybe, a princess can do anything"}, {"start": 946.383, "end": 949.759, "text": "A prince does, if she keeps trying,"}, {"start": 948.659, "end": 951.289, "text": "And never gives up."}, {"start": 950.189, "end": 953.449, "text": "Do you think I can make the team?"}, {"start": 952.349, "end": 954.658, "text": "I know you can, sofia."}, {"start": 953.892, "end": 959.049, "text": "But what's important is what you think."}, {"start": 968.069, "end": 970.339, "text": "Amber, everyone's here!"}, {"start": 970.019, "end": 975.229, "text": "It's a good thing I wore my derby tiara."}, {"start": 974.129, "end": 977.834, "text": "Oh! He's here!"}, {"start": 976.734, "end": 979.57, "text": "Prince hugo!"}, {"start": 979.17, "end": 981.395, "text": "Well, today's the big day."}, {"start": 980.295, "end": 982.07, "text": "Are you ready, sofia?"}, {"start": 984.209, "end": 986.929, "text": "Thanks, mom!"}, {"start": 985.829, "end": 988.842, "text": "James, why are there so many people here?"}, {"start": 987.742, "end": 991.841, "text": "They want to know if a princess can make the team."}, {"start": 990.741, "end": 992.972, "text": "So let's show them."}, {"start": 992.249, "end": 994.85, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 1002.21, "end": 1004.364, "text": "You ready, minimus?"}, {"start": 1003.264, "end": 1005.972, "text": "Ready for what? Turning around"}, {"start": 1004.872, "end": 1007.188, "text": "And going back to the stable?"}, {"start": 1006.087, "end": 1008.47, "text": "You bet. Great idea."}, {"start": 1007.37, "end": 1011.79, "text": "Minimus. We are going to do great."}, {"start": 1010.69, "end": 1014.07, "text": "I know it."}, {"start": 1028.705, "end": 1032.761, "text": "As everyone knows, the first two riders"}, {"start": 1031.661, "end": 1035.65, "text": "To cross the finish line earn their place"}, {"start": 1034.55, "end": 1038.427, "text": "On royal preps flying derby team!"}, {"start": 1037.327, "end": 1040.561, "text": "So without further ado,"}, {"start": 1039.461, "end": 1042.79, "text": "Horses on your wings,"}, {"start": 1041.69, "end": 1044.683, "text": "Get set,"}, {"start": 1043.583, "end": 1045.63, "text": "Go!"}, {"start": 1044.53, "end": 1048.81, "text": "Announcer: And they're off!"}, {"start": 1048.65, "end": 1051.55, "text": "Announcer: Prince hugo takes the early lead,"}, {"start": 1050.45, "end": 1055.23, "text": "With prince james just behind him."}, {"start": 1063.349, "end": 1065.97, "text": "Announcer: Here comes princess sofia!"}, {"start": 1064.87, "end": 1068.08, "text": "She's making her way through the pack."}, {"start": 1067.317, "end": 1073.77, "text": "It looks like we need to take the princess out of the race."}, {"start": 1082.93, "end": 1087.79, "text": "See ya, princess!"}, {"start": 1086.69, "end": 1090.49, "text": "That's not right."}, {"start": 1090.65, "end": 1093.01, "text": "Boo hugo!"}, {"start": 1091.91, "end": 1094.24, "text": "Are you all right?"}, {"start": 1093.14, "end": 1094.548, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1093.447, "end": 1097.0, "text": "What are you doing? Get back on your horse."}, {"start": 1095.9, "end": 1099.477, "text": "What's the point, james? I blew it."}, {"start": 1098.377, "end": 1101.77, "text": "But go! You can still win."}, {"start": 1100.67, "end": 1102.85, "text": "So could you."}, {"start": 1101.75, "end": 1106.21, "text": "I'm not crossing the finish line without you."}, {"start": 1113.05, "end": 1118.245, "text": "The princess is back in the race!"}, {"start": 1117.145, "end": 1118.928, "text": "Go, sofia!"}, {"start": 1134.109, "end": 1136.523, "text": "There's hugo!"}, {"start": 1135.423, "end": 1139.15, "text": "And there's the steeple."}, {"start": 1138.05, "end": 1141.03, "text": "Oh, come on, sofia."}, {"start": 1139.93, "end": 1141.65, "text": "Beat hugo!"}, {"start": 1140.55, "end": 1144.13, "text": "You can do it!"}, {"start": 1143.03, "end": 1147.51, "text": "Let's go! Okay!"}, {"start": 1147.53, "end": 1150.135, "text": "We can do this!"}, {"start": 1149.035, "end": 1151.641, "text": "Oh, I don't know!"}, {"start": 1150.541, "end": 1152.77, "text": "Well, I do. Hee-yaw!"}, {"start": 1152.172, "end": 1154.78, "text": "Here we go!"}, {"start": 1166.63, "end": 1170.709, "text": "Minimus: I did it!"}, {"start": 1169.609, "end": 1173.725, "text": "How did she"}, {"start": 1172.625, "end": 1174.73, "text": "Whoa!"}, {"start": 1180.469, "end": 1183.223, "text": "All she has to do is pass hugo,"}, {"start": 1182.123, "end": 1185.49, "text": "And she'll win!"}, {"start": 1184.39, "end": 1187.888, "text": "Announcer: And, as they turn down the stretch,"}, {"start": 1186.787, "end": 1190.843, "text": "It's hugo, james, and sofia neck in neck!"}, {"start": 1191.368, "end": 1195.1, "text": "All right, minimus. Here we go!"}, {"start": 1207.609, "end": 1210.275, "text": "Announcer: Princess sofia and prince james"}, {"start": 1209.175, "end": 1216.069, "text": "Have won the try-out race, and made the team!"}, {"start": 1214.969, "end": 1217.464, "text": "Great job, minimus."}, {"start": 1216.364, "end": 1219.79, "text": "We won. We actually won."}, {"start": 1218.69, "end": 1222.303, "text": "Wait, does that mean they'll expect us to win the next race?"}, {"start": 1221.203, "end": 1223.27, "text": "And the one after that?"}, {"start": 1222.17, "end": 1226.15, "text": "Oh, I think I need to lie down!"}, {"start": 1225.05, "end": 1229.209, "text": "oh, minimus."}, {"start": 1228.109, "end": 1230.74, "text": "Oh, thank you, james!"}, {"start": 1229.639, "end": 1233.193, "text": "I couldn't have done it without you."}, {"start": 1232.092, "end": 1235.397, "text": "Same here. I never would have made the team"}, {"start": 1234.297, "end": 1237.51, "text": "If I didn't spend all that time practicing with you."}, {"start": 1237.054, "end": 1242.97, "text": "I hereby present you both"}, {"start": 1257.69, "end": 1260.689, "text": "What a race. Well done, you two."}, {"start": 1259.969, "end": 1264.39, "text": "We did it, dad!"}, {"start": 1263.69, "end": 1266.74, "text": "I made the team, mom."}, {"start": 1265.639, "end": 1268.689, "text": "Oh, I knew you could."}, {"start": 1267.589, "end": 1272.21, "text": "Hmm. Huh."}, {"start": 1271.11, "end": 1273.97, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 1275.75, "end": 1280.41, "text": "Princess amber."}, {"start": 1280.01, "end": 1283.59, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 1283.45, "end": 1285.915, "text": "You were great, sofia."}, {"start": 1285.27, "end": 1290.418, "text": "I was wrong. Flying derby is a princess thing."}, {"start": 1289.318, "end": 1292.8, "text": "Anything can be if we try hard enough."}, {"start": 1294.17, "end": 1297.58, "text": "That's what they gave you for winning?"}, {"start": 1296.48, "end": 1301.209, "text": "Oh, no. You need a real prize."}, {"start": 1300.109, "end": 1303.99, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 1303.53, "end": 1306.28, "text": "But that's your derby tiara."}, {"start": 1305.18, "end": 1309.87, "text": "I want you to have it."}, {"start": 1309.41, "end": 1312.46, "text": "Because, I'm your biggest fan."}, {"start": 1311.36, "end": 1313.24, "text": "You know,"}, {"start": 1312.14, "end": 1315.069, "text": "I won, too."}, {"start": 1313.969, "end": 1316.19, "text": "I know."}]